"provider":"mal","id":"22817","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"23587","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79460","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79460","scope":"s5","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"92065","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Black Butterfly Murder - File 1","titleLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"The Gokumon Prep School study retreat begins and the conditions are even harsher than Kindaichi was expecting! Not only that, he and Miyuki are put in a separate group, although they both hear hints of a group of six students who did something unforgivable in the past and now fear deadly retribution. Whose strings are the Puppeteer from Hell pulling and what is he going to make them do?!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79460/4896186.jpg"},{"title":"Black Butterfly Murder - File 2","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10442","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20642","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"22817","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"23587","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79460","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79460","scope":"s5","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"92066","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Black Butterfly Murder - File 2","titleLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Chaos ensues when the bodies of four missing students are discovered murdered and positioned in grisly ways patterned after class topics. Kindaichi and Inspector Akechi collaborate by phone from their separate murder sites, but are stumped when everyone has an alibi. Will the Puppeteer from Hell have the last laugh?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79460/4896187.jpg"},{"title":"Black Butterfly Murder - File 3","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10442","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20642","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"mal","id":"22817","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"23587","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79460","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79460","scope":"s5","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumbers":[13]}],"link":"92067","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Black Butterfly Murder - File 3","titleLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Kindaichi discovers the secret that punctures everyone's supposedly airtight alibi! He assembles both groups, explains the reasoning behind the theme murders, and calls out the identity of Sparrow, the serial murderer of six students! Except as it turns out, Sparrow is actually...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79460/4914396.jpg"},{"title":"Black Butterfly Murder - File 4","episodeNumber":14,"sourceEpisodeNumber":14,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10442","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20642","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"mal","id":"22817","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"23587","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79460","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79460","scope":"s5","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumbers":[14]}],"link":"92068","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Black Butterfly Murder - File 4","titleLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Kindaichi reveals the identity of the second murdering Sparrow! But how did the Puppeteer from Hell convince two law-abiding people to commit serial murder? And what fate lies in store for all three criminals?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79460/4919532.jpg"},{"title":"Hayami Reika's Kidnap Murder Case - File 1","episodeNumber":15,"sourceEpisodeNumber":15,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10442","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20642","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"mal","id":"22817","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"23587","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79460","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79460","scope":"s5","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumbers":[15]}],"link":"92069","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Hayami Reika's Kidnap Murder Case - File 1","titleLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Hajime, Miyuki, Inspector Kenmochi, and Superintendent Akechi are on JAM flight 377, despite the terrorist threat received right before takeoff. They're getting closer to home when smoke suddenly fills the plane from the rear and the passengers panic, thinking it's terrorism. But things aren't what they appear as Hajime and Akechi soon find themselves trying to solve a locked-room murder case 10,000 meters in the air!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79460/4919533.jpg"},{"title":"Hayami Reika's Kidnap Murder Case - File 2","episodeNumber":16,"sourceEpisodeNumber":16,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10442","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20642","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"mal","id":"22817","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"23587","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79460","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79460","scope":"s5","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumbers":[16]}],"link":"92070","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Hayami Reika's Kidnap Murder Case - File 2","titleLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Hajime and Akechi team up to expose Captain Shida's killer... or is that killers?! Whatever the case, it leads to a situation where the plane itself (including the hundreds of passengers inside) is put in a perilous position and only one person has a shot of saving them all... but it's not Hajime!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79460/4919534.jpg"},{"title":"Hayami Reika's Kidnap Murder Case - File 3","episodeNumber":17,"sourceEpisodeNumber":17,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10442","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20642","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"mal","id":"22817","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"23587","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79460","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79460","scope":"s5","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumbers":[17]}],"link":"92071","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Hayami Reika's Kidnap Murder Case - File 3","titleLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"One of Kindaichi's earliest cases is a delicate situation as the 14-year-old Hajime is on the trail of Miyuki's missing panties (and watch) from a campground. Complicating matters is the fact that Hajime himself is one of only three suspects, all of whom seem to have an ironclad alibi.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79460/4919535.jpg"},{"title":"Hayami Reika's Kidnap Murder Case - File 4","episodeNumber":18,"sourceEpisodeNumber":18,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10442","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20642","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"mal","id":"22817","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"23587","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79460","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeN